title: Safe Houses
subtitle: Posters on every wall call for the murder of our leaders.
view-if: crisis_january = 1 and jan_hide_done = 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; jan_hide_done = 1
frequency: 100
is-card: true
new-page: true
tags: crisis

= Safe Houses

"Workers, citizens! Kill their leaders! Kill Liebknecht!" The posters are paid for by the Anti-Bolshevist League. Luxemburg still goes to the *Rote Fahne* office to write the paper. [? if e19_lieb_committee = 1 : Liebknecht still sits with the Revolutionary Committee. ?] Jogiches wants them both out of sight today.

- @flats: Find them flats the police do not know.
- @out: Get them out of Berlin.
- @recall: Pull Liebknecht off the Revolutionary Committee.

@flats
subtitle: Costs 1 fund.
view-if: e19_hide = 0
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: We have no funds.
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
Q.e19_hide = 1;
Q.crisis_line_3 = 'Luxemburg and Liebknecht: in safe flats';
!}

Comrades in Neukölln lend rooms. The leaders will move every second night, and the couriers learn the addresses by heart.

@out
subtitle: Jogiches gives it even odds. If they are seen at a station, the police will know they are still in Berlin.
on-arrival: {!
if (Math.random() < 0.5) {
    Q.e19_hide = 2;
    Q.e19_lieb_committee = 0;
    Q.crisis_line_3 = 'Luxemburg and Liebknecht: out of Berlin';
} else {
    Q.e19_seen = 1;
}
Q.ultraleft_satisfaction -= 4;
!}

[? if e19_hide = 2 : Luxemburg goes only after a quarrel, and only as far as Frankfurt. Liebknecht follows on a goods train the next night. ?][? if e19_hide != 2 : A railwayman warns the couriers that the Potsdam station is full of plain-clothes men. The leaders turn back, and someone has seen them. ?]

@recall
subtitle: Jogiches has been demanding it for days. The Committee will call it desertion.
view-if: e19_lieb_committee = 1
on-arrival: e19_lieb_committee = 0; ultraleft_satisfaction -= 6; lean_luxemburgist += 1

Liebknecht resists, then gives way. The Committee carries on without him.
